[I] GPU and accelerator process monitor

[T] NVTOP stands for Neat Videocard TOP, a (h)top like task monitor for GPUs
[T] and accelerators. It can handle multiple GPUs and print information
[T] about them in a htop-familiar way.

[U] https://github.com/Syllo/nvtop

[A] Maxime Schmitt <Syllo@users.noreply.github.com>
[M] dot-mike <d0tmike@pm.me>

[C] extra/graphic
[F] CROSS

[L] GPL3
[V] 3.4.0

[D] bf6d0623851043d2f28b9eaa1120b5ba5726ba2cda6b32063313c96f nvtop-3.4.0.tar.gz https://github.com/Syllo/nvtop/archive/3.4.0/

if ! pkginstalled libdrm; then
	var_append cmakeopt ' ' -DAMDGPU_SUPPORT=OFF
	var_append cmakeopt ' ' -DINTEL_SUPPORT=OFF
	var_append cmakeopt ' ' -DMSM_SUPPORT=OFF
	var_append cmakeopt ' ' -DPANFROST_SUPPORT=OFF
	var_append cmakeopt ' ' -DPANTHOR_SUPPORT=OFF
	var_append cmakeopt ' ' -DV3D_SUPPORT=OFF
fi
